    "Two regression excerpts replaced with fictional text; real archived fixtures omitted.",
    "Separate synthetic example and delivery smoke scripts added, with pinned dependencies and public usage documentation.",
    "Normalize guard line endings and omit an unused legacy repair bridge referring to a nonpublished prior-harness helper; active guard behavior preserved."
